nce library and the legal depository of all works published in Uganda. It has been a depository for the United Nations since 1956.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Makerere University Library","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Library_day.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Library_day.jpg","w":1200,"h":807,"author":"Monitor Newspaper","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Library_day.jpg"}},{"id":"kampala_nommo_gallery","areaId":"kampala","name":"Nommo Gallery","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":0.32012,"lng":32.58005},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kampala_nommo_gallery","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://gou.go.ug/content/nommo-gallery#","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":10,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["nommogallery","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon; Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Uganda’s National Art Gallery. Calm, spacious, green oasis in the middle of the city with art exhibitions (paintings and sculptures that can be bought) and two restaurants frequented by government employees.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kampala","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Nommo_Art_Gallery.jpg/1280px-Nommo_Art_Gallery.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Nommo_Art_Gallery.jpg/500px-Nommo_Art_Gallery.jpg","w":1200,"h":675,"author":"Kateregga1","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nommo_Art_Gallery.jpg"}},{"id":"kampala_lubiri","areaId":"kampala","name":"Lubiri","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":0.30144,"lng":32.56665},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kampala_lubiri","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.buganda.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":1,"commonsNearby":5,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["lubirikampala","kampala"],"summary":"Royal compound of the Kabaka/king. Historically significant place, but not much to see. The original Lubiri was destroyed in 1966 when Milton Obote took power and the Kabaka fled the country. To the west along the Lubiri Ring Road is Kabaka's Lake, a man-made body of water ordered by King Mwanga of Buganda that you can walk around or canoe in, but, whew-wee, there's a little bit of a stink problem","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kampala","names":{"zh":"蒙戈王宮"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Buganda.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/Buganda.jpg","w":1200,"h":650,"author":"Wikimedia Commons contributor","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Buganda.jpg"}},{"id":"kampala_national_theatre","areaId":"kampala","name":"National Theatre","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":0.31579,"lng":32.58913},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kampala_national_theatre","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.uncc.co.ug/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":6,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["nationaltheatre","kampala"],"summary":"A big cultural centre with a theatre that also hosts dance shows/lessons/events, comedy, films, concerts, jam sessions, improv and discussion nights. The current program can be found at the entrance or online on social media or [https://www.uncc.co.ug/calendar/events&#124;the website]. Every Monday there's a music night with live music from artists on stage. There is a restaurant located inside th","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kampala","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Uganda_National_Theatre_building.jpg/1280px-Uganda_National_Theatre_building.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Uganda_National_Theatre_building.jpg/500px-Uganda_National_Theatre_building.jpg","w":1200,"h":675,"author":"Kateregga1","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uganda_National_Theatre_building.jpg"}},{"id":"kampala_shri_sanatan_dharma_mandal_temple","areaId":"kampala","name":"Shri Sanatan Dharma Mandal Temple","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":0.31047,"lng":32.57883},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kampala_shri_sanatan_dharma_mandal_temple","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.ssdmuganda.org","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":5,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-20"},"hashtags":["shrisanatandharmamandaltemple","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"16:00","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"A longstanding Hindu temple in Kampala where the emphasis is on Lord Shiva.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Kampala","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Shree_Sanatan_Dharma_Mandal_temple_%28Kampala%29_06.JPG/1280px-Shree_Sanatan_Dharma_Mandal_temple_%28Kampala%29_06.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Shree_Sanatan_Dharma_Mandal_temple_%28Kampala%29_06.JPG/500px-Shree_Sanatan_Dharma_Mandal_temple_%28Kampala%29_06.JPG","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Ruslik0","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shree_Sanatan_Dharma_Mandal_temple_(Kampala)_06.JPG"}},{"id":"kampala_wv_evening_out_in_kabalagala","areaId":"kampala","name":"Evening out in Kabalagala","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":0.29794,"lng":32.60174},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_evening_out_in_kabalagala","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["eveningoutinkabalagala","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Kabalagala is an area with many bars and restaurants that is very lively at night and popular both amongst locals and expats. Go there, have fun and get to know some locals, but keep in mind that some girls (not the majority) are actually there to work. Kabalagala has everything from shabby waragi shacks to fancy establishments like Club Venom at the top of Tirupati Mazima Mall.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_great_wall","areaId":"kampala","name":"Great Wall","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":0.31297,"lng":32.58298},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_great_wall","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["greatwall","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Owned by Chinese from Beijing, this clean and comfortable restaurant serves big portions of tasty, classic dishes. Menu is in English and simplified Chinese (with strange character mistakes - I suppose 15 years away is a long time). There is a ceiling fan and service is attentive, polite and extremely rapid by Ugandan standards. If you've got a bony bum, bring a cushion.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_clubbing_in_the_industrial_area","areaId":"kampala","name":"Clubbing in the Industrial Area","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":0.32107,"lng":32.60124},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_clubbing_in_the_industrial_area","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["clubbingintheindustrialarea","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Some very fancy clubs with steep prices, others more normal, lots of showing off, students enjoying themselves, dance floors fill easily, good dancing, some old mzungu men, hookers, ... partly bizarre but in the end the same as everywhere else around the world. The popular Club Silk, Ange Noir and T1 are on First Street. Several other clubs are on 6th Street.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_expat_night_at_bubbles_olearys","areaId":"kampala","name":"Expat night at Bubbles O’Leary’s","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":0.3329,"lng":32.58684},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_expat_night_at_bubbles_olearys","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/BubblesOLearys","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["expatnightatbubblesolearys","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Bubbles is an Irish pub in Kampala that serves as the main expat hangout (along with several other places along Acacia Avenue). Go there to get some (shocking) insights into the giant industry that is NGOs, aid and volunteering in Uganda.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_evening_out_in_bukoto","areaId":"kampala","name":"Evening out in Bukoto","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":0.34817,"lng":32.59768},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_evening_out_in_bukoto","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["eveningoutinbukoto","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Bukoto began as a purely residential suburb, but is now spawning many popular nightlife spots. Good alternative to Kabalagala and less mzungus than further down along Acacia Avenue.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_the_roots_restaurant","areaId":"kampala","name":"The Roots Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":0.32704,"lng":32.58257},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_the_roots_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.therootsrestaurant.ug/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["therootsrestaurant","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A fancy downtown villa serving traditional Ugandan cuisine. Best known for their luwombo and fish dishes. Try snagging a table in their garden when there is good weather.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_the_lawns_restaurant_lounge_bar","areaId":"kampala","name":"The Lawns Restaurant & Lounge Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":0.32752,"lng":32.59861},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_the_lawns_restaurant_lounge_bar","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.thelawns.co.ug/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thelawnsrestaurantloungebar","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Good if you want a quiet and tranquil environment. The Lawns offers beautiful garden lounge bar. Try their wide range of cocktails or wine with amazing starters.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_fang_fang","areaId":"kampala","name":"Fang Fang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":0.31348,"lng":32.58412},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_fang_fang","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://fangfang.co.ug/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["fangfang","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Large, plush, well furnished place with many private side and meeting rooms. Well stocked bar. Authentic menu and cuisine.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"},{"id":"kampala_wv_1000_cups_coffee_house","areaId":"kampala","name":"1000 Cups Coffee House","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":0.31734,"lng":32.57636},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"kampala_wv_1000_cups_coffee_house","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/1000Cups-Coffee-215569201792497/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["1000cupscoffeehouse","kampala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"08:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Upscale coffee shop popular amongst mzungus. Serving several regional varieties of coffee, American style.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kampala"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}